// Ashfang Raiders captains - named people of the clan, spliced into default.amd's
// `## Captains` section via `File: captains/ashfang.amd`. A captain belongs to a
// clan, flies a ship, embodies reputation poles (Values), roams a system (hailable
// at its station), and has a `Rival when:` guard that turns him hostile against
// the player's PERSONAL standing with him. His voice is authored in dialogue with
// `Speaker: <his key>`.

# [Vex Karr](vex)
---
Side: ashfang
Title: the Ash-Captain
Values: cruel 40, fearsome 30, violent 20
Flies: Torgoth
Roams: 8, -5
Rival when: standing < -20
---
A scarred raider who runs the Ashfang lanes and collects grudges like trophies.
Cross him and he does not forget.
